            "desc_loc": "<h1>Active: Meteor Hammer</h1> CHANNELED - After a %max_duration%s channel, summons a meteor after %land_time%s that strikes a %impact_radius% AoE, stunning enemies for %stun_duration%s and dealing %impact_damage_units% impact damage. Continues to deal %burn_dps_units% damage per second for %burn_duration%s.<br><br>Non-building units take an additional %impact_damage_units_pct_health%%% max health impact damage and are slowed by %burn_slow%%% for %burn_duration%s.<br><br>Deals %building_damage_pct%%% damage to buildings.\n\n<h1>Passive: Celestial Flare</h1>After any of your disables ends on an enemy unit, they burn for %burn_per_second% damage a second and move %slow_pct%%% slower for %passive_debuff_duration%s.<br>Celestial Flare can trigger from any of your abilities or items.<br>Celestial Flare stacks with Meteor Hammer's Burn.",
